# d2-build-helper — Overview

## Tech Stack

- Kotlin 2.3.10 + Compose Multiplatform 1.10.1 (material3 1.9.0)
- AGP 9.0.0, Android minSdk 26 / targetSdk 36 / compileSdk 36
- Gradle 9.4.1, Java target 17
- Apollo Kotlin 4.3.1 — Stratz GraphQL (in `:shared:core-network`)
- Supabase Storage 3.1.0 — hero/item/ability icons (in `:shared:core-storage`)
- Ktor 3.3.3 — OkHttp on Android+JVM, Darwin on iOS
- Coil 3.2.0 — image loading
- kotlinx.coroutines 1.10.2, kotlinx.serialization 1.10.0
- compose-navigation 2.9.2, MP lifecycle-viewmodel 2.9.6
- Koin 4.1.x for DI (per-module Koin module functions; aggregated in `:shared:main`)
- MVIKotlin 4.4.0 (BaseExecutor + `coreMVIKotlinModule` in `:shared:core-mvikotlin`)
- moko-mvvm 0.16.1 (CFlow/CStateFlow for iOS contract on `BaseViewModel`)
- Napier 2.7.1

## Module Layout

16 modules under `android/` and `shared/`. KMP layout per module: `src/{commonMain,commonTest,androidMain,jvmMain,iosMain}/kotlin/...`. Convention plugins (`kmp-library`, `kmp-feature-setup`, `compose-multiplatform-setup`, `android-application-setup`, `json-serialization`) live in `build-logic`.

| Module | Type | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| `:android:app` | Android-only | `com.android.application`, `AndroidApp`, `AppActivity`, manifest. |
| `:shared:main` | KMP shell | `App.kt` + NavHost + `jvmMain/main.kt` desktop entry + `iosMain/main.kt` iOS framework entry. Composition Root for Koin. |
| `:shared:common` | KMP | `coRunCatching`, `ResultExtensions`, `OneTimeEvent`, `TimeConverter`, `Mapper`, `CoroutineDispatchers`, `commonModule`. |
| `:shared:common-ui` | KMP + Compose | `LocalImageLoader`, `D2BuildHelperTheme`. |
| `:shared:common-resources` | KMP + moko-resources | Shared `moko-resources/` (strings, JSON files, fonts). Generated `MR` in `dev.nonoxy.d2buildhelper.common.resources`. |
| `:shared:core-domain` | KMP | App-wide pure models: `Hero`, `Item`, `Ability`, `ImageResources`. |
| `:shared:core-navigation` | KMP + Compose | `AppScreens`, `LocalNavHost`. |
| `:shared:core-network` | KMP | Apollo + GraphQL + Stratz buildConfig + Ktor engines. `coreNetworkModule`. |
| `:shared:core-mvikotlin` | KMP | `BaseExecutor`, `coreMVIKotlinModule`. Re-exports `mvikotlin-core/main/logging/coroutines`. |
| `:shared:core-presentation` | KMP | `BaseViewModel<S,L>`, `BaseIosViewModel` (depends on `:shared:core-mvikotlin`). |
| `:shared:core-storage` | KMP | Supabase client + Supabase buildConfig. `coreStorageModule`. |
| `:shared:core-resources` | KMP | `ResourcesRepository(Impl)`, image/constants datasources, `coreResourcesModule`. |
| `:shared:feature-guides:api` | KMP | `GuidesStore` + Intent/State/Label + `Guide` model. |
| `:shared:feature-guides:impl` | KMP | Store factory/executor/reducer + repository + datasources + DTOs + `featureGuidesImplModule`. |
| `:shared:feature-guides:presentation` | KMP | `GuidesViewModel` + UI models + mappers + `featureGuidesPresentationModule`. |
| `:shared:feature-guides:ui` | KMP + Compose | `GuidesScreen` + sub-views. |

`build-logic/` is a composite build with shared utilities (`AppVersion`, `GitCommitCountValueSource`) and the convention plugins. The `kmp-feature-setup` plugin selects auto-wiring by submodule name (`api`/`impl`/`presentation`/`ui`) — see `mobile-architecture.mdc#build-conventions` for the exact dependency contract.

## Package Conventions

Package root: `dev.nonoxy.d2buildhelper`. Module segment determines the sub-package:

| Module | Package |
|---|---|
| `:android:app` | `.android` |
| `:shared:main` | (top-level — `App.kt`, etc.) |
| `:shared:common` | `.common.*` |
| `:shared:common-ui` | `.common.ui` and `.common.ui.theme` |
| `:shared:common-resources` | `.common.resources` (generated `Res`) |
| `:shared:core-domain` | `.core.domain` |
| `:shared:core-navigation` | `.core.navigation` |
| `:shared:core-network` | `.core.network` (+ generated GraphQL in `.graphql`) |
| `:shared:core-mvikotlin` | `.core.mvikotlin` and `.core.mvikotlin.di` |
| `:shared:core-presentation` | `.core.presentation.viewmodel` |
| `:shared:core-storage` | `.core.storage` |
| `:shared:core-resources` | `.core.resources.{data,di}` |
| `:shared:feature-guides:api` | `.feature.guides.api.{store,domain}` |
| `:shared:feature-guides:impl` | `.feature.guides.impl.{data,domain,di}` |
| `:shared:feature-guides:presentation` | `.feature.guides.presentation.{models,mappers,di}` |
| `:shared:feature-guides:ui` | `.feature.guides.ui.{,views}` |

## Naming Conventions

| Entity | Pattern | Example |
| --- | --- | --- |
| ViewModel | `{Feature}ViewModel` | `GuidesViewModel` |
| Screen composable | `{Feature}Screen` | `GuidesScreen` |
| View composable | `{Feature}View` | `GuidesView` |
| Sub-views directory | `views/` | `guides/ui/views/` |
| Store interface | `{Feature}Store` | `GuidesStore` |
| Store Intent | `{Feature}Store.Intent` | `GuidesStore.Intent` |
| Store State | `{Feature}Store.State` | `GuidesStore.State` |
| Store Label | `{Feature}Store.Label` | `GuidesStore.Label` |
| UI state | `Ui{Feature}State` | `UiGuidesState` |
| UI label | `Ui{Feature}Label` | `UiGuidesLabel` |
| State mapper | `Ui{Feature}StateMapper` | `UiGuidesStateMapper` |
| Label mapper | `Ui{Feature}LabelMapper` | `UiGuidesLabelMapper` |
| Repository contract | `{Topic}Repository` | `GuidesRepository`, `ResourcesRepository` |
| DataSource interface | `{Topic}Api` | `GuidesApi`, `ImageResourcesApi` |
| DataSource impl | `{Topic}DataSource` | `GuidesDataSource`, `ImageResourcesDataSource` |
| Mapper file | `{Topic}Mappers.kt` | `GuideMappers.kt` |
| Koin module fun | `{moduleName}Module` | `commonModule`, `coreNetworkModule`, `featureGuidesImplModule` |

## Existing Features

- `:shared:feature-guides:*` — list of high-rated builds for a hero (Stratz GraphQL + Supabase icons + local hero JSON).
- `features/detailGuide/` — placeholder screen still inside `:shared:main`, not yet implemented.

Navigation routes are declared in `:shared:core-navigation/.../AppScreens.kt` as a sealed class of route strings. `LocalNavHost` exposes the `NavHostController` to children.
